      "review_summary": "The PR adds repeatable `--file` support to `openclaw infer image generate`, forwards collected files into `runImageGenerate`, updates capability metadata/tests, and changes infer CLI docs.\n\nPR surface: Source +8, Tests +47, Docs +1. Total +56 across 3 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. source-level: current main and v2026.6.11 register `image generate` without `--file`, while `image edit` and `runImageGenerate` already have the file-backed `inputImages` path. I did not run the CLI because this review is read-only.",
